message: "If you use AOVGuard in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "AOVGuard: EXR Structure Inspection and AOV Validation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Medina G."
    given-names: "Joshua A."
version: 1.2.1
date-released: 2026-09-18
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  AOVGuard is a Python tool for automatic OpenEXR structure inspection,
  frame-first AOV analysis, configurable validation rules, sequence checking,
  and structured reporting for VFX lighting and pipeline workflows.
keywords:
  - OpenEXR
  - AOV
  - VFX pipeline
  - render validation
  - lighting
